request.description:
## Full Home Screen Query

Fetches **all** sections in a single HTTP round-trip. Designed for app launch — render everything from one response.

### Sections returned
- `bannerSection` — promotional banners with CTA
- `gendersAndCategories` — Women / Men / Kids / All with sub-categories
- `bestSellingProducts` — top 10 by sales
- `trendingProducts` — top 10 by wishlist count
- `newAndNoteworthy` — latest 10 listings
- `accessoriesProducts` — 10 from accessory categories
- `recentlyViewedProducts` — last 10 viewed by this user
- `budgetCategories` — 8 categories with products ₹99–₹500
- `quickBuySection` — first 10 quick-buy products + pagination info

### Sample Response
```json
{
  "data": {
    "homeScreen": {
      "bannerSection": {
        "ctaLabel": "View Offers",
        "ctaAction": "VIEW_OFFERS",
        "banners": [
          {
            "id": "1",
            "image": "http://localhost/nileShopping/public/uploads/banners/banner_1.jpg",
            "title": "Season Sale – Up to 50% Off",
            "redirectType": "url",
            "redirectValue": "/offers/season-sale",
            "displayOrder": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "bestSellingProducts": [
        {
          "productId": "3",
          "productName": "Premium Cotton Kurta",
          "sellingPrice": 499.00,
          "mrp": 799.00,
          "rating": 4.2,
          "isFavorite": false,
          "images": ["http://localhost/nileShopping/public/uploads/listings/5/front.jpg"]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

