request.description:
## Quick Buy – In-Place Pagination

Does **not** navigate to a new page. The mobile app appends new items to the existing Quick Buy list on the home screen when the user taps 'View More'.

Increment `page` by 1 on each 'View More' tap. Stop showing the button when `paginatorInfo.hasMorePages = false`.

### Infinite Scroll Pattern (Flutter)
```dart
int _page = 1;
bool _hasMore = true;
List<Product> _products = [];

void loadMore() async {
  if (!_hasMore) return;
  final result = await graphqlClient.query(
    QueryOptions(
      document: QUICK_BUY_QUERY,
      variables: {'first': 10, 'page': _page},
    ),
  );
  final data = result.data!['quickBuyProducts'];
  _products.addAll(parseProducts(data['data']));
  _hasMore = data['paginatorInfo']['hasMorePages'];
  _page++;
}
```

