request.description:
## Offer Banners

Fetches only the banner section from the home screen response. Efficient for banner-only refreshes.

### Redirect Handling (client-side)
```js
switch (banner.redirectType) {
  case 'url':      navigate(banner.redirectValue); break;
  case 'category': navigate('/category/' + banner.redirectValue); break;
  case 'product':  navigate('/product/' + banner.redirectValue); break;
}
```

### Sample Response
```json
{
  "data": {
    "homeScreen": {
      "bannerSection": {
        "ctaLabel": "View Offers",
        "ctaAction": "VIEW_OFFERS",
        "banners": [
          { "id": "1", "image": "https://.../banner_1.jpg", "title": "Season Sale", "redirectType": "url", "redirectValue": "/offers/season-sale", "displayOrder": 1, "isActive": true },
          { "id": "2", "image": "https://.../banner_2.jpg", "title": "Women's Collection", "redirectType": "category", "redirectValue": "women", "displayOrder": 2, "isActive": true },
